⦁	Write a NumPy program to convert the values of Centigrade degrees into Fahrenheit degrees and vice versa.
#Fahrenheit degree to Centigrade degree.
Code:

import numpy as np
fvalues = [0, 12, 45.21, 34, 99.91, 32]
F = np.array(fvalues)
print("Values in Fahrenheit degrees:") print(F)
print("Values in Centigrade degrees:") print(np.round((5*F/9 - 5*32/9),2)) Output:
Values in Fahrenheit degrees:
[ 0. 12. 45.21 34. 99.91 32. ]
Values in Centigrade degrees:
